<<~ ahu #/ooda-ha>>

✶ observe: source law already names meme, invariant, memetic-wikitext, loci, and implements lanes.
⏿ orient: the compiler must treat these as composable interfaces, not decorative headings.
◇ decide: validate carrier truth before lowering syntax into AST, graph, or render products.
▶ act: preserve the five lanes, their checks, and compiler order as a typed contract.
↺ verify: each lane names both compiler use and MCP-facing use; adapt: deeper parser/render detail routes to sibling loci.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/five-lanes>>

!! Five Compiler Input Lanes

| Lane | Source law | Compiler use | MCP-facing use |
|---|---|---|---|
| carrier shape | `meme` | shape validation, rating/depth classification, residue detection | boot receipts, diagnostics, conformance hints |
| compressed core | `invariant` | boot-priority selection, cache policy, companion-meme split validation | high-priority hydration packets |
| surface semantics | `memetic-wikitext` | lexer/parser contracts, primitive-aware AST seeds | source resources, grammar-aware prompts |
| stable routing | `loci` | URI resolution, carrier-tree index, declared-unresolved index | resource namespaces and templates |
| composed capability | the has-stack | component validation and routing | family-filtered resources/tools/prompts |

The compiler begins from lawful carriers plus the components they declare wearing.
It should not begin from markdown files plus links.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/meme-shape>>

!! Meme Copy-Shape Contract

| Surface | Compiler check | Artifact consequence |
|---|---|---|
| doctype comment | present before active sigils | carrier class gate |
| document opener | parses and matches `#meta.uri-path` | source identity |
| `ahu #meta` | TOML payload parses | metadata extraction |
| title / opening scope | readable boundary appears early | summary and receipt text |
| body thresholds | open/close pair present | active body span |
| six-glyph OODA-HA | compact loop present | process metadata |
| edges block | outward adjacency explicit or honestly absent | relation inventory |
| return throat | unresolved residue marked | uncertainty artifact |

Rating states move from Noise → Data → Meme → Typed Meme → Canon Typed Meme.
Depth states remain distinct: resolved, declared-unresolved, absent.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/invariant-pressure>>

!! Invariant Pressure Contract

Invariant carriers stay short, exact, stable, cacheable, and companion-aware.
The compiler should check compressed OODA-HA presence, active operational voice, visible worksite anchors, absence of template placeholders outside template roots, and separation between core law and explanatory swell.

Compiler yield:

* boot-priority selection
* cache policy
* companion-meme split diagnostics
* template-vs-filled invariant distinction

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/memetic-wikitext-primitives>>

!! Memetic-Wikitext Primitive Contract

| Primitive | Lawful job | First lowering target |
|---|---|---|
| `ahu` | local worksite / anchor / context | scoped block or container node |
| `loulou` | outward relation sugar | `pranala` relation edge |
| `aka` | passive inclusion / shadow reveal | transclusion edge or passive include node |
| `kahea` | active invocation / live transclusion pressure | transclusion edge or invoke node |
| `kapu` | qualification, trust, boundary, disclosure | qualification node / annotation |
| `ui` | query surface | query node |
| `hana` | bounded guest-work site | guest-region node |
| `?` | explicit unresolved pressure | unresolved token / residue node |

Boot grammar atoms include opener, closer, route arrow, anchor, TOML payload, control sigils, and uncertainty markers.
Parser legality and render machinery stay separate.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/loci-routing>>

!! Loci Routing Contract

| Concern | Compiler use | MCP use |
|---|---|---|
| root eligibility | validate `\w.\w.\w` tuple roots | resolver errors |
| stable origin | map `ha.ka.ba` into `packages/lares-core/memes/` | canonical file resources |
| all-caps roots | reserve `AGENTS`, `LARES`, `INDEXES` | root and virtual namespaces |
| primary carrier path | derive file path from URI | `resources/read` |
| child item path | sibling dir named for terminal segment | future carrier-tree reads |
| declared-unresolved | preserve missing-but-named targets | backlog and diagnostics |
| address stability | compare opener, file path, and register | cache and promotion posture |

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/interface-bundles>>

!! Composition as a Stack of Components

''A carrier is nameless but for its `lar:` address.'' Everything else it WEARS: components named in the
meta `tags` field, each a carrier at its own address that speaks for what wearing it asks. Composition
stays additive — a carrier may wear `meme`, `loci`, `invariant` and any family's component at once.

''The stack carries no role vocabulary.'' No implements, no owns, no defines: a component means what
its own meme says, and the edge means only that the carrier holds it. Relations richer than composition
ride `loulou` and `kahea`, or reify as a component that speaks for itself.

The compiler indexes the components carriers wear, checks each against the meme that defines it, and
routes by what a carrier HOLDS — never by what it is. ''A fixed enum of blessed components reads as the
interface sneaking back''; a bare entry whose definition has not landed stands declared-unresolved, a
lawful and promotable state.

Common stacks:

| Stack | Reading |
|---|---|
| `meme + loci` | minimum placed carrier with stable-address pressure |
| `meme + loci + invariant` | boot/core pressure with stable routing |
| `meme + loci + a family's own` | a carrier whose family extends the routing floor |

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/compiler-order>>

!! Recommended Compiler Order

# validate `meme` copy-shape
# validate `invariant` pressure/cacheability when declared
# extract the has-stack components
# resolve `loci` and parent/child tree
# parse memetic-wikitext primitives
# lower `pranala` edges
# lower AST → execution → render

Carrier truth stays ahead of syntax swell.

<<~/ahu>>

